From 9b0b02e7aa714f75ae75f1eb75944c72ffb0a40b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:11:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] 001-nlogn-block-construction

Preserve the custom dependency-snapshot block assembler. Fold the independently corrected V1 scheduler and V2 regression tests into this topic: direct-parent deduplication, ready modified-fee heap, live size/sigcheck checks, and release of children only after successful inclusion. This does not introduce CPFP package selection.

Original source commit: a654e773c8109bf71108aa3d18b59919a753330e
Corrected scheduler source: 1f4211946604dfb22ae1fc2b310d0cee56b3839e
V1 reference: 0b7939e926b8353ad09d8edc47f355ddacc30502
---
